{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54227","headline":"句 · 僧鸾","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鳌头浪蹙掀天白，鲸目光烧半海红。\n（见宋吴垧《五总志》）（按：《全唐诗》卷八五一据《增修诗话总龟》卷八收「唐末蜀沙门」尔鸟逸句二，与此二句全同，惟前後互乙。\n今考僧尔鸟未见唐人记载。\n「鸾」字离作「、鸟」二字，与「尔鸟」二字字形极相近。\n可知「僧尔鸟」必爲「僧鸾」之形讹，非另有其人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧鸾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}